{"id":1749393,"retrievedAt":"2026-08-15T11:41:03.795Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[],"homepage":"","id":1749393,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_title":"Mat Rukun","overview":"# Mat Rukun  The story follows Roslan and Khatijah who are worried because despite being 21 years old, Mamat's spoiled behavior still hasn't changed. Mamat also enjoys spending time on frivolous activities with his friends. At their wit's end, Roslan and Khatijah ask their friends for advice. Many offer various methods and ways, some of which are even illogical, until one of their friends suggests that Mamat should get married. Perhaps through marriage, Mamat's behavior will mature and become more responsible. Of course, Mamat disagrees, feeling he is still too young to get married and hasn't had enough of enjoying life. But after being pressured, Mamat finally agrees on one condition. Mamat wants Roslan and Khatijah to find a Kedah girl with beautiful skin, delicate like a mountain girl. Roslan and Khatijah agree because they too would be pleased to have a village girl as a daughter-in-law. Once again with the help of their friends, they search for a girl matching Mamat's request.","popularity":0.0071,"poster_path":"/vtsyjjAhJ7xw66QUiiV4WkIRIFb.jpg","production_companies":[],"production_countries":[],"release_date":"2017-01-01","revenue":0,"runtime":0,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"Mat Rukun","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":1771028,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Zoey Rahman","original_name":"Zoey Rahman","popularity":0.6492,"profile_path":"/t2pzWVccMAnm2R2OsQLznxXuJKe.jpg","cast_id":2,"character":"","credit_id":"6a7f249ba0f9254ed92d31bb","order":0},{"adult":false,"gender":1,"id":2321922,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Eli